logs/

# Editor and operating-system noise. Shared VS Code settings may be tracked.
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json

